# Validation report: {{ name }}, {{ desk }} desk

{{ statement() }}

Sections in the order of SR 11-7 guidance on model risk management.

## Purpose

Rank {{ "card transactions" if desk == "payments" else "successful sign ins" }} so the desk's policy can
step up or decline the riskiest within a friction budget registered before the test months were scored
(plan {{ v("plan.sha256") }}).

## Data

{% if desk == "payments" %}TabFormer transactions with simulated chargeback labels, training months
{{ v("plan.payments.train.start") }} to {{ v("plan.payments.train.end") }}, labels as known at the training
cut. Test months {{ v("plan.payments.test.start") }} to {{ v("plan.payments.test.end") }}.
{% else %}RBA sign ins, training months {{ v("plan.logins.train.start") }} to {{ v("plan.logins.train.end") }},
with synthetic attackers for training users; test months {{ v("plan.logins.test.start") }} to
{{ v("plan.logins.test.end") }} with synthetic attackers for held out users. The unknown account bucket is
excluded.{% endif %}

